999
va khong phu thuoc AutoCAD. Don vi: milimet. Xem tests/suites/revit-write-mep.json.
999
Noi dung co y gai dung nhung truong hop bo loc cua C4 phai xu ly:
999
  TUYEN-ONG      : 2 doan thang hang noi duoi nhau (0,0)-(6000,0)-(10000,0)  -> gop thanh 1
999
