999
  TUYEN-ONG      : 1 doan rac dai 20 mm                                       -> bi loai boi minLengthMm
999
  TUYEN-ONG-TEXT : 1 doan tren layer ghi chu                                  -> bi loai boi excludeLayers
999
  RAC            : 1 doan tren layer khong khai                               -> bi loai boi includeLayers
